SUMMARY:Lancaster County's Best Kept Secrets Tour
DESCRIPTION:Embark on a unique shopping\, dining\, and entertainment adventure featuring 44 hand-picked\, off-the-beaten-path destinations. Designed like a self-guided home or garden tour\, you can travel at your own pace in your own vehicle while enjoying complimentary refreshments\, games\, gifts\, farm and workshop tours\, demos\, and hands-on projects. \n\n\n\nYour ticket is valid for the entire event\, allowing you to explore everything in a single day or take the full 16 days. Along the way\, collect entry tickets to play our Shop & Win game for a chance at over $1\,000 in prizes\, enter a drawing for a $200 shopping spree\, and redeem exclusive coupons at every location. \n\n\n\nWe keep the specific business names a surprise\, but tour-goers can expect an incredible mix: home décor and furnishings\, an olive oil taproom\, artisan crafts\, thrift and consignment shops\, vibrant farm markets\, a luxury chocolatier\, and much more. \n\n\n\nLocated across Lancaster County\, the tour is carefully mapped so you’ll never drive more than 15 miles between stops—and most are much closer. \n\n\n\nTickets are $12\, with $1 per ticket donated to Lighthouse Vocational Services. Each ticket booklet includes a comprehensive guide with business addresses and descriptions\, an easy-to-use map\, an event calendar\, and exclusive coupons. Plus\, the first 2\,000 ticket purchasers will receive a free goody bag filled with gifts and promotional items. \n\n\n\nReserve your spot now! Call 717-721-9409 or visit www.bestkeptsecretstour.com. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-countys-best-kept-secrets-tour/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Shopping-ladies-autumn.avif
END:VEVENT
