SUMMARY:Family Monster Throwdown! Ages 6 – Adult at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Unleash your creativity in this fun and engaging family class where participants ages 6 and up will learn to design and draw their very own unique monsters using a variety of art materials including colored pencils\, markers\, paints\, and more. Through hands-on exploration\, families will discover fundamental character design principles such as shape\, expression\, and texture while experimenting with different mediums to bring their monstrous creations to life! \n\n\n\n This is the perfect class for all levels of creativity and a great opportunity to bond learning something new! NOTE: Registration covers up to four (4) family members. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/family-monster-throwdown-ages-6-adult-at-pcad/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania College of Art & Design – Center for Creative Exploration\, 204 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
