SUMMARY:DNA & Dead Ends: Cracking Family Mysteries with Eric Schubert
DESCRIPTION:Unlock the secrets of your family history! Eric Schubert leads this afternoon program on using DNA and genealogical research to solve family mysteries. Registration is required through the Lancaster Public Library. \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/dna-dead-ends-cracking-family-mysteries-with-eric-schubert/
