SUMMARY:Fall Printmaking Exploration: Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for an afternoon workshop exploring the process of printmaking! We will be creating leaf prints using a variety of media\, creating fall trees with finger printing\, and using mixed media approaches to add to our prints. This will be a wonderful afternoon of learning about fall\, the seasons\, and how to interpret our view of this beautiful time of year! Expect your child to have some lecture and guidance followed by open creativity! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/fall-printmaking-exploration-grades-1-3-at-pcad/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania College of Art & Design – Center for Creative Exploration\, 204 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
