SUMMARY:Stephen Schwartz: A Benefit Concert for Prima
DESCRIPTION:Broadway legend Stephen Schwartz — the Grammy\, Oscar\, and Tony Award–winning composer of Wicked\, Pippin\, Godspell\, Pocahontas\, and others — comes to Lancaster County for a once-in-a-lifetime benefit event at Rock Lititz.    \n\n\n\n At the piano\, Schwartz offers his most treasured songs and behind-the-scenes stories\, accompanied by Prima’s extraordinary vocalists and musicians\, creating a rare and intimate evening of artistry and heart. But this evening is about more than a concert. It’s a moment to fuel the next great cultural movement in Lancaster. Rock Lititz showed that the world’s biggest tours can start here. Prima is proving that tomorrow’s great theatrical works can\, too. This benefit event fuels Prima’s mission to invigorate lives through fresh theatrical experiences — performances that are intimate\, joyful\, and deeply human.  \n\n\n\nYour support helps: -Launch bold new theatrical works born in Lancaster-Bring renowned creative voices to our community-Give audiences world-class experiences first\, right here at home.This night ensures Lancaster isn’t just consuming culture — it’s creating it. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/stephen-schwartz-a-benefit-concert-for-prima/
LOCATION:Rock Lititz\, 100 Rock Lititz Blvd\, Lititz\, PA 17543\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/STEPHEN-SCHWARTZ-Square-800-x-800-px.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Prima Theatre":MAILTO:info@primatheatre.org
END:VEVENT
